  "instructions": [
    "Combine chopped onion and minced garlic in a large saucepan over medium heat, cooking for 3 minutes until softened.",
    "Add sliced carrots, celery, and cucumber to the saucepan, cooking for 5 minutes until the vegetables are slightly tender.",
    "Pour in cold water and chicken broth, then bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover the saucepan with a lid, and let it simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in freshly chopped dill and lemon juice, then season the broth to taste.",
    "Strain the broth through a fine-mesh sieve into a large bowl, discarding the solids.",
    "Serve the Light Croatian Vegetables Broth hot, garnished with additional dill if desired."
